title: Commvault Active Jobs
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Lists all currently active jobs (running, waiting, pending, ...) with
 type, progress and wait reason, and checks their runtime against upper levels
 (default 24 h / 72 h, ruleset "Commvault active jobs"). The ruleset can set
 own levels (or no levels) per job type; the type is matched case-insensitively
 against the job type name reported by the API. Every job line shows which
 limit applied. The number of active and waiting jobs is recorded as metrics.

discovery:
 One service on the host running the Commvault REST special agent.
